.TH rayscan-scripts-uninstall 1  "uninstall " 
.SH NAME
rayscan\-scripts\-uninstall \- Remove an installed pack from the local script library
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBuninstall\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove an installed pack from the local script library
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>
Installed pack name (library subdirectory)
